p=r/'help/index.html';s=p.read_text(encoding='utf-8-sig');s=s.replace('<section><h2>Inspect keyboard shortcuts', '<section><h2>Inspect menus and commands</h2><p>Open a project and choose <strong>Menus and commands</strong> at the upper right. Select a command to read its menu path, caption, action, shortcut codes, flags, source evidence and diagnostics. Filter by command kind or text. Next page advances through 250 rows; First page resets.</p><p>Scroll the command bar horizontally to reach <strong>Command source</strong>, <strong>Action source</strong>, the handler selector and <strong>Explain handler</strong>. Select the specific click, execute, update or popup binding before explaining it. Unresolved bindings disable Explain. Source commands require attached, unchanged text; detached, changed and binary locations are refused explicitly.</p><p>Paths follow serialized parents. Runtime order, dispatch precedence and state remain unobserved; missing properties remain unknown. Readable shortcut labels and possible conflicts are on Keyboard and focus. Full directions: <code>docs/guides/Menus_and_Commands_Run_and_Test.txt</code>. Developers: run <code>tools/build-commands.cmd</code> elevated.</p></section><section><h2>Inspect keyboard shortcuts');p.write_text(s,encoding='utf-8')
